@startuml Sequence - Send Command
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
autonumber

actor "Admin / External Client" as Admin
participant "API Gateway" as Gateway #DDDDDD
participant "router-manager-service\ngRPC Server" as Grpc #BBFFFF
participant "Security Middleware" as Sec #FFDDDD
participant "Command Service" as CmdSvc #FFFFBB
participant "Validation" as Val
participant "Command Repository" as CmdRepo
database "PostgreSQL" as DB #DDFFDD
participant "Metrics" as Metrics #FFEECC
participant "Logger" as Logger #EEFFEE
participant "Tracer" as Tracer #CCCCFF

== Отправка команды (Admin → Service) ==

Admin -> Gateway: POST /api/v1/send-command\n{router_id?, command_type, payload}
activate Admin
activate Gateway

Gateway -> Grpc: gRPC SendCommand(request)\n[JWT + mTLS]\ntraceparent: 00-traceid-spanid-01
activate Grpc

Grpc -> Tracer: Start span "send-command"\n(trace_id, span_id, parent_id)
activate Tracer
Tracer --> Grpc: span context
deactivate Tracer

Grpc -> Sec: Check: IP Whitelist, Rate Limit, JWT
activate Sec
Sec --> Grpc: OK / Error(403/429)
deactivate Sec

alt Проверка не пройдена
    Grpc -> Tracer: Record error "permission_denied"
    activate Tracer
    Tracer --> Grpc: recorded
    deactivate Tracer

    Grpc --> Gateway: gRPC error (PERMISSION_DENIED / RESOURCE_EXHAUSTED)
    Gateway --> Admin: HTTP 403/429
    deactivate Grpc
    deactivate Gateway
    deactivate Admin
else Проверка успешна
    Grpc -> CmdSvc: ExecuteSendCommand(request)\n[span context]
    activate CmdSvc

    CmdSvc -> Tracer: Start span "validate-command"
    activate Tracer
    Tracer --> CmdSvc: child span
    deactivate Tracer

    CmdSvc -> Val: ValidateRequest(request)
    activate Val
    Val --> CmdSvc: error / nil
    deactivate Val

    CmdSvc -> Tracer: End span "validate-command"
    activate Tracer
    Tracer --> CmdSvc: ended
    deactivate Tracer

    alt Валидация не пройдена
        CmdSvc -> Tracer: Record error "validation_failed"
        activate Tracer
        Tracer --> CmdSvc: recorded
        deactivate Tracer

        CmdSvc --> Grpc: ValidationError
        Grpc --> Gateway: gRPC error (INVALID_ARGUMENT)
        Gateway --> Admin: HTTP 400
        deactivate CmdSvc
        deactivate Grpc
        deactivate Gateway
        deactivate Admin
    else Валидация успешна
        CmdSvc -> Tracer: Start span "find-routers"
        activate Tracer
        Tracer --> CmdSvc: child span
        deactivate Tracer

        CmdSvc -> CmdRepo: FindRouters(router_id or ALL)
        activate CmdRepo
        CmdRepo -> DB: SELECT FROM routers [WHERE id=$1 or ALL]
        activate DB
        DB --> CmdRepo: []Router
        deactivate DB
        CmdRepo --> CmdSvc: routers[]
        deactivate CmdRepo

        CmdSvc -> Tracer: End span "find-routers"
        activate Tracer
        Tracer --> CmdSvc: ended
        deactivate Tracer

        par Для каждого роутера (массовая команда)
            CmdSvc -> Tracer: Start span "create-command"
            activate Tracer
            Tracer --> CmdSvc: child span
            deactivate Tracer

            CmdSvc -> CmdRepo: CreateCommand(router_id, type, payload, PENDING)
            activate CmdRepo
            CmdRepo -> DB: BEGIN; INSERT INTO commands ... RETURNING id; COMMIT
            activate DB
            DB --> CmdRepo: command_id
            deactivate DB
            CmdRepo --> CmdSvc: Command{status=PENDING}
            deactivate CmdRepo

            CmdSvc -> Tracer: Set span attribute "command_id", "router_id"
            activate Tracer
            Tracer --> CmdSvc: attributes set
            deactivate Tracer

            CmdSvc -> Tracer: End span "create-command"
            activate Tracer
            Tracer --> CmdSvc: ended
            deactivate Tracer

            CmdSvc -> Logger: Log: "Command created"\n{command_id, router_id, status}\n[trace_id]
            activate Logger
            Logger --> CmdSvc: logged
            deactivate Logger

            CmdSvc --> CmdSvc: metrics.commandSentTotal.Inc()\n[Alloy scrapes /metrics]
            note right of CmdSvc
              Alloy (prometheus.scrape) периодически
              опрашивает /metrics и пушит в Prometheus
            end note
        end

        CmdSvc -> Tracer: Start span "export-traces"
        activate Tracer
        Tracer --> CmdSvc: batch export
        deactivate Tracer

        CmdSvc --> Grpc: SendCommandResponse{command_ids[]}
        deactivate CmdSvc

        Grpc -> Tracer: End span "send-command"\n(status=OK)
        activate Tracer
        Tracer --> Grpc: span ended
        deactivate Tracer

        Grpc -> Tracer: Export spans to Alloy\n[OTLP/gRPC: trace_id, spans[]]
        activate Tracer
        Tracer --> Grpc: exported
        deactivate Tracer

        Grpc -> Logger: Log: "SendCommand completed"\n{count=len(ids)}\n[trace_id]
        activate Logger
        Logger --> Grpc: logged
        deactivate Logger

        Grpc --> Gateway: gRPC response OK
        deactivate Grpc
        Gateway --> Admin: HTTP 201 {command_ids: [...]}
        deactivate Gateway
        deactivate Admin
    end
end

note right of DB
  Атомарность: каждая команда
  сохраняется в отдельной транзакции.
  При массовых командах —
  возможна оптимизация через batch INSERT.
end note

note right of Metrics
  Observability:
  • command_sent_total{type, router_id}
  • send_command_duration_seconds
  • errors_total{source="validation"}
end note

note right of Tracer
  Tracing:
  • trace_id: уникальный ID запроса
  • span_id: ID операции
  • parent_id: связь с родительским span
  • attributes: command_id, router_id, status
  • Export: OTLP/gRPC → Alloy → Tempo
end note
@enduml